questions.question_text:
Which shape is the front view?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (A) at (0,0); \coordinate (B) at (2.7,0); \coordinate (C) at (1.35,1.9);
\coordinate (D) at (1,0.7); \coordinate (E) at (3.7,0.7); \coordinate (F) at (2.35,2.6);
\draw (A)--(B)--(C)--cycle; \draw (B)--(E)--(F)--(C); \draw[dashed] (A)--(D)--(E) (D)--(F);
\draw[-{Stealth}] (1.5,-1.2)--(1.5,-0.3); \node[below] at (1.5,-1.2) {Front};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which description matches the top view?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (A) at (0,0); \coordinate (B) at (2.5,0); \coordinate (C) at (1.25,1.8);
\coordinate (D) at (1.1,0.8); \coordinate (E) at (3.6,0.8); \coordinate (F) at (2.35,2.6);
\draw (A)--(B)--(C)--cycle; \draw (B)--(E)--(F)--(C); \draw[dashed] (A)--(D)--(E) (D)--(F);
\draw[-{Stealth}] (2,4)--(2,3.2); \node[above] at (2,4) {Top};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which shape is the side view?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (A) at (0,0); \coordinate (B) at (3.3,0); \coordinate (C) at (3.3,2); \coordinate (D) at (0,2); \coordinate (E) at (1,0.7); \coordinate (F) at (4.3,0.7); \coordinate (G) at (4.3,2.7); \coordinate (H) at (1,2.7);
\draw (A)--(B)--(C)--(D)--cycle; \draw (B)--(F)--(G)--(C) (D)--(H)--(G); \draw[dashed] (A)--(E)--(F) (E)--(H);
\draw[-{Stealth}] (5.4,1.2)--(4.6,1.2); \node[right] at (5.4,1.2) {Side};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which solid matches all the given views?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\small}]
\draw (0,0)--(2.6,0)--(1.3,1.8)--cycle;
\node[below] at (1.3,-0.2) {Front / Back};
\draw (3.6,0) rectangle (6.8,1.8);
\node[below] at (5.2,-0.2) {Side};
\draw (7.8,0) rectangle (10.4,3.2);
\draw (9.1,0)--(9.1,3.2);
\node[below] at (9.1,-0.2) {Top};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which solid matches all the given views?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\small}]
\draw (0,0)--(3,0)--(2.4,2)--(0.6,2)--cycle;
\node[below] at (1.5,-0.2) {Front / Back};
\draw (4,0) rectangle (7.4,2);
\node[below] at (5.7,-0.2) {Side};
\draw (8.4,0) rectangle (11.4,3.4);
\draw (9,0)--(9,3.4) (10.8,0)--(10.8,3.4);
\node[below] at (9.9,-0.2) {Top};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
